# Secrets — credentials must never be committed.
# Pattern is anchored with ** so it matches at any depth from the repo root.
# Template at barksense/firmware/include/secrets.h has placeholders; once you
# fill in real credentials, `git update-index --skip-worktree <path>` ensures
# this rule actually protects you for the already-tracked template.
**/firmware/include/secrets.h
